      "contribution": "Supplied the finite-order trace argument and the tensor-conjugacy step for the tensor-induced case of Proposition 5.2, the GT12 Section 5.2 route for the extraspecial 2^{1+6} case, and the corrected scalar-order patterns in Section 7; pointed to Guralnick-Tiep Cor. 1.6 and checked GT3 Prop. 2.8, Marin-Michel normalizers and the hypotheses of p58 Thm 2.2(3) in the primary sources; audited Lemmas 3.5 and 7.1 and two review packets, and independently reran the U5(2).2 certificates.",
